          "ruleIndex": 16,
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "The metadata of this ERC-721 collection change after the mint (the reveal is delayed), but the plan does not say that the contract emits the events of ERC-4906 (erc4906 is false). A contract with that extension emits MetadataUpdate or BatchMetadataUpdate when the JSON metadata change, so that marketplaces refresh the tokens. Fix: Add the ERC-4906 extension to the contract, emit BatchMetadataUpdate at the reveal and MetadataUpdate on each later change, and set metadata.erc4906 to true."
